# FF4: a test fight with Cecil and the child Rydia - Cecil fights, Rydia casts Cure on
# herself and then Blizzard on a Goblin. Run with:
#   FF3.exe --game=ff4 --map=t01_00 --party=4:10 --drive=Docs/Drives/ff4-battle-magic.drive --log=general,file
# and read logs/ff3.log for the "battle:" lines (Testing.md C-43, C-44).
until jump: ff4 60
wait 6
press K
until battle: encounter 20
# Cecil's turn: Fight, first Goblin.
until battle: Cecil may act 30
wait 0.3
press Z
wait 0.4
press Z
# Rydia's turn: Magic, Cure (first in her list), on herself.
until battle: Rydia may act 30
wait 0.3
press Down
wait 0.3
press Z
wait 0.4
press Z
wait 0.4
press Z
# Cecil again.
until battle: Cecil may act 30
wait 0.3
press Z
wait 0.4
press Z
# Rydia again: Magic, the fifth spell (Blizzard - the grid has three columns, so Right then Down), on the first Goblin standing.
until battle: Rydia may act 30
wait 0.3
press Down
wait 0.3
press Z
wait 0.4
press Right
wait 0.25
press Down
wait 0.3
press Z
wait 0.4
press Z
# Whoever acts next fights until the Goblins are gone (the fight may already be won).
until battle: (won|(Cecil|Rydia) may act) 30
wait 0.3
press Z
wait 0.4
press Z
until battle: (won|(Cecil|Rydia) may act) 30
wait 0.3
press Z
wait 0.4
press Z
until battle: won 60
say fight over
wait 2
# Close the result and let the battle end (the stage swaps back on FF4).
press Z
until battle: back 10
wait 6
say back on the field
quit
